  "description": "Extra (switch move, park-and-ride, runs by type, reversibility). switch[Car] at (3,3) = 0xF0FF: leaving +x (nibble 2) a car trip may become Walk (type 0). Walk is allowed (not starting), can reach destinations, invMaxSpeed[Walk][Street] = 1.0, and (4,3) has pedestrian info. The Walk node at (4,3) costs 1.5 + r24(1.0 + 0.0) = 2.5 < 3.0 and is the goal. Park-and-ride: the Walk node's cell, side EdgeTo((3,3) -> (4,3)) = 0. Compressed: 01 02 03, run 41 01 02 (Car), run 40 01 02 (Walk); mask 0x3. Reversible: at (3,3) the next type (Walk) differs and switch[Car] nibble e = 2 is 0, not 0xF; with 0xFFFF it is not.",
